{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です٩( 'ω' )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだお友達と\n桜を見に行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイミングが良く\nこれぞ満開！って感じ(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年おおよそお花見はしますが\n今年は流し見のお花見でした◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/04/08/6247494/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと続く桜に惚れ惚れしながら\n食べ歩き～～◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/04/08/6247494/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わいわいしてる雰囲気が\nお祭りみたいで楽しかったな～～◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは地元で\nレジャーシート引いて\nご飯たくさん買って\nフリスビーとかするけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうお花見もとても良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年はどこに行こうかな～～◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎あさひなぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着々と準備の進む舞台。\nまだ薙刀のお稽古しかしていませんが\n全然出来なくて焦っております..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、\n今日はとある高校の薙刀部さんに\nお邪魔してきました～～◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/04/08/6247494/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現役高校生のパワーを\n吸いまくってきましたよ。ええ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薙刀部の皆さんはとても\nキラキラしていて\nとてもカッコよかったな～～◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も負けてられないですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに"},{"ty